WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Go move. I'll go back first.

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:12,930
Captain Beauty, why are you so happy?

3
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:16,180
Be loyal to me and I will tell you

4
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:19,180
I swear to be absolutely loyal to Captain Beauty from now on

5
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,180
Never betray, never run away

6
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:23,180
Life and death follow each other, just like this

7
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:25,180
Wrecking bones and scattering ashes, sent to eighteen levels of hell

8
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:29,590
Bitten by millions of evil spirits, he will never be reincarnated.

9
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:30,590
Get lost
